    "body": "What do you think about this?\r\n\r\n```suggestion\r\n        let mut iter = env_vars\r\n            .iter()\r\n            .filter(|env_var| !env_var.starts_with('!'))\r\n            .peekable();\r\n\r\n        iter.peek().is_none() || iter.any(|env_var| self.get_env(env_var).is_some())\r\n```",
